	TAD	ADA2		/CORRECT TO LOWER.
	TAD	ADA3		/AND ADD IN UPPER.
	DCA I	ATEMP2		/AND THEN SAVE AWAY.
	JMP I	ABOP		/AND THEN EXIT.
